Rules for this monorepo were moved to the repository root.

- `/.cursor/rules/` — Cursor rules (`general.mdc`, `architecture.mdc`, `domain.mdc`)
- `/AGENTS.md` — quick map and commands for agents

Content previously defined here is reflected in `/.cursor/rules/general.mdc` (adapted from the legacy React-oriented file to the current Vite + Turborepo web stack).
